Just a couple of funny things from my last trip in the dungeon.

I had built up a great HP (-16 w/o armor) through #chatting, had 
sacrified a lot and wanted to try if my god would give me a gift
when praying (Read about intrisic cliarvoyance sometime ago). 
That bloody sucker said I was arrogant and took all 
my intrisic HP away. Well, I was tired of the game and started praying
and praying. At last I got him real angry:
"A bolt of lightning misses you ...,
 but the ray of desintegration does.
 You lay basking in the desintegration beem for a minute..."

"A voice booms: I believe it not!" 

Reeeaally laughed at that last one.

On another topic; magic traps are one of my favorites. Once you
have sufficient strength (+scare monster scroll of good rustproofing)
just go on and off the magic trap. You are blinded, which doesn't matter
much, and 2-5 monsters are generated. Great way of getting experiance,
food and items. The setting is perfect for many types of abuse, i.e. 
polypiling or tinning for intrisics. The trap often lasts 30 times or more,
which is a lot better than a bag of tricks or wand/scroll of create monster.

Erik


